---
const points = ["Today's tasks on the home screen, the rest in the calendar", 'Tap a task to jump to where it was said'];
---

<section>
  <div class="panel">
    <div class="copy">
      <span class="eyebrow">Only in Echo</span>
      <h2>Say it out loud. It becomes a task.</h2>
      <p class="lead">Echo pulls what needs doing out of your transcript. If you mentioned a time, it reminds you then.</p>
      <ul>
        {
          points.map((point) => (
            <li>
              <span class="check">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.25" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
              </span>
              {point}
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="demo">
      <div class="said">
        <div class="speaker"><span class="dot"></span><span class="name">You</span><span class="time">0:04 – 0:11</span></div>
        <p>I think <mark>tomorrow at 10 a.m. I have to go to the dentist</mark>, and after that I'll pick up the parcel.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 5v14"></path><path d="m19 12-7 7-7-7"></path></svg>
      </div>
      <div class="task">
        <span class="box"></span>
        <div class="task-body">
          <span class="task-title">Dentist appointment</span>
          <span class="reminder"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 8a6 6 0 0 1 12 0c0 7 3 9 3 9H3s3-2 3-9"></path><path d="M10.3 21a1.94 1.94 0 0 0 3.4 0"></path></svg>Tomorrow, 10:00 AM · reminder on</span>
        </div>
        <span class="chip">New task</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  section {
    padding: 0 24px 104px;
  }
  .panel {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border-radius: 28px;
    background: var(--sage-soft);
    padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px);
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 48px;
  }
  .copy {
    flex: 1 1 420px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--success);
  }
  h2 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(30px, 3.6vw, 42px);
    line-height: 1.1;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }
  .lead {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--text-ctl);
  }
  ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  li {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  .check {
    color: var(--success);
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .demo {
    flex: 1 1 420px;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .said {
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--card);
    box-shadow: var(--hairline), 0 1px 2px rgba(58, 49, 37, 0.06);
    padding: 22px 24px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .speaker {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  .dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #bd8a58;
  }
  .name {
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .time {
    color: var(--text-3);
  }
  .said p {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }
  mark {
    background: rgba(212, 163, 115, 0.34);
    color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 0 3px;
  }
  .arrow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    color: var(--sage-glyph);
  }
  .task {
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--raised);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px -6px rgba(58, 49, 37, 0.16), 0 2px 6px -3px rgba(58, 49, 37, 0.06);
    padding: 18px 20px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .box {
    width: 24px;
    height: 24px;
    flex: none;
    border-radius: 7px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1.5px var(--control);
  }
  .task-body {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }
  .task-title {
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .reminder {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 6px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }
  .chip {
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--success);
    background: var(--sage-chip);
    padding: 5px 10px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    section {
      padding: 0 20px 72px;
    }
    .task {
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
  }
</style>
